   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,000:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  → imagem original (np.ndarray / Mat)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,001:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,002:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: mat_processada
