   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,010:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3. Métodos Disponíveis
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,011:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Categoria | Métodos OpenCV | Método Manual (★) |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,029:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,031:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |-----------|---------------|-------------------|
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,032:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,034:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 🎨 Cor | Cinza, HSV, Lab,
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,253:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: YCrCb, HLS | ★Cinza-Manual |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,254:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,257:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 🔵 Filtro | Gaussiano, Mediana, Bilateral, Cartoon | ★Média-Manual |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,518:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 📐 Borda | Canny,
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Laplaciano, Sobel X/Y | ★Sobel-Manual |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,521:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,524:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | ⬛ Binarização | Otsu, Adaptativo, Global | ★Otsu-Manual |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,525:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,528:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 🔷 Morfologia | Abertura,
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,760:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Fechamento, Erosão, Dilatação, Gradiente | ★Erosão-Manual |
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,763:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4. Implementações Manuais
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,764:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4.1 ★Cinza-Manual — Conversão de cor
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,785:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O que faz:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,787:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Converte BGR para escala de cinza sem usar 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,790:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cv2.cvtColor
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,792:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,794:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Fórmula (ITU-R BT.601):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,796:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Y = 0.299 × R  +  0.587 × G  +  0.114 × B
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,798:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Por que esses pesos?
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,800:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  O olho humano é mais sensível ao verde, por isso ele tem o maior peso (0.587).
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,801:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Código:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,802:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: def _cinza_manual(self, img_bgr):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,803:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     b = img_bgr[:, :, 0].astype(np.float64)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,806:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     g = img_bgr[:, :, 1].astype(np.float64)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,809:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     r = img_bgr[:, :, 2].astype(np.float64)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,811:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     cinza = (0.114 * b + 0.587 * g + 0.299 * r).astype(np.uint8)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,813:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     return cinza
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,816:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4.2 ★Média-Manual — Filtro passa-baixa
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,817:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O que faz:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,818:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Suaviza a imagem aplicando a média dos vizinhos em uma janela k×k.
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,819:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Princípio:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,820:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Cria um kernel onde cada peso = 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,821:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1/(k²)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,824:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  e faz convolução 2D.
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,825:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Exemplo kernel 3×3:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,826:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ┌─────────────────────┐
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,827:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 1/9   1/9   1/9     │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,828:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 1/9   1/9   1/9     │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,829:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 1/9   1/9   1/9     │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: └─────────────────────┘
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,833:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Código:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,835:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: def _media_manual(self, img, k):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,838:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     kernel = np.ones((k, k), dtype=np.float32) / (k * k)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,841:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     return cv2.filter2D(img, -1, kernel)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,844:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4.3 ★Sobel-Manual — Detector de bordas
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,845:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O que faz:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,847:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Detecta bordas calculando o gradiente da imagem nas direções X e Y.
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,849:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Kernels definidos manualmente:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,851:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gx (bordas verticais):       Gy (bordas horizontais):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,852:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ┌──────────────┐              ┌──────────────┐
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,854:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ -1   0   1   │              │ -1  -2  -1   │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,857:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ -2   0   2   │              │  0   0   0   │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,858:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ -1   0   1   │              │  1   2   1   │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,860:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: └──────────────┘              └──────────────┘
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,861:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Magnitude:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,862:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,865:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: M = √(Gx² + Gy²)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,867:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Código:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,869:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: def _sobel_manual(self, gray):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,873:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     kx = np.array([[-1, 0, 1], [-2, 0, 2], [-1, 0, 1]],
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,874:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: dtype=np.float32)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,876:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     ky = np.array([[-1, -2, -1], [0, 0, 0], [1, 2, 1]],
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,876:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: dtype=np.float32)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     gx = cv2.filter2D(gray, cv2.CV_64F, kx)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,879:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     gy = cv2.filter2D(gray, cv2.CV_64F, ky)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,881:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     magnitude = cv2.magnitude(gx, gy)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     return cv2.convertScaleAbs(magnitude)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4.4 ★Otsu-Manual — Binarização
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O que faz:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,892:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Encontra automaticamente o melhor limiar para separar fundo e objeto, sem usar 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,893:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cv2.THRESH_OTSU
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,894:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,895:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Algoritmo:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,896:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,897:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Calcular o histograma da imagem (256 valores)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,898:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,899:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Para cada limiar 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,900:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: t
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,903:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  de 0 a 255:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,904:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Separar pixels em duas classes (fundo e objeto)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,910:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,911:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Calcular a 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: variância entre classes
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,913:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O limiar que 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: maximiza
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,915:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  a variância é o ideal
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,916:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Código resumido:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,918:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: def _otsu_manual(self, gray):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,919:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     hist = cv2.calcHist([gray], [0], None, [256], [0, 256]).ravel()
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,921:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     # Para cada t: calcula variância = peso_bg × peso_fg × (média_bg -
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,923:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: média_fg)²
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,925:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     # Retorna o t que maximiza a variância
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,927:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     resultado = np.zeros_like(gray)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,928:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     resultado[gray > melhor_limiar] = 255
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,930:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     return resultado
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,933:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4.5 ★Erosão-Manual — Morfologia matemática
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,934:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: O que faz:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,935:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Para cada pixel, verifica a vizinhança k×k e atribui o 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,936:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: valor mínimo
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,937:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,939:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Efeito:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,941:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Encolhe regiões brancas e remove ruídos pequenos.
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,942:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Princípio:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,944:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pixel de saída = MIN(vizinhança k×k)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,945:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Exemplo 3×3:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,947:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ┌─────────────┐
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,948:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 200 180 190 │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,949:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 210 220 205 │  →  resultado = min(todos) = 180
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,950:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │ 195 215 200 │
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,951:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: └─────────────┘
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,952:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Código:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,954:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: def _erosao_manual(self, img, k):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,957:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     h, w = img.shape[:2]
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,958:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     pad = k // 2
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,959:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     padded = cv2.copyMakeBorder(img, pad, pad, pad, pad,
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,961:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                                  cv2.BORDER_CONSTANT, value=255)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,962:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     resultado = np.zeros_like(img)
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,964:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     for i in range(h):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,965:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         for j in range(w):
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,966:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:             vizinhanca = padded[i:i + k, j:j + k]
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,967:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:             resultado[i, j] = vizinhanca.min()
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,968:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     return resultado
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,970:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5. Como Executar
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,971:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .\venv\Scripts\python.exe ferramenta_imagens.py
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,973:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Dependências:
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,975:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  OpenCV, NumPy, Pillow, Tkinter (nativo do Python).
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,977:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 6. Fluxo de Uso
   DEBUG: 2026-05-14 08:45:40,978:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
